# Hullbreacher: "If an opponent would draw a card except the first one they draw in each of their draw steps, instead you
# create a Treasure token." Bot1 flashes it in on turn 1 with Sol Ring and Black Lotus. On turn 2 Bot2 draws for the
# turn as usual (the exempt first card of its draw step), then casts Brainstorm: all three of its draws are replaced,
# so it draws nothing and Bot1 gets three Treasure tokens. Brainstorm still makes Bot2 put two cards back, so its hand
# shrinks to four and its library grows to fifteen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Hullbreacher
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Brainstorm
Island x6
Mountain
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Hullbreacher.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Brainstorm.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
Bot2.Library.Count = 15
Bot1.Battlefield = Hullbreacher; Island; Sol Ring; Treasure Token; Treasure Token; Treasure Token
